-- (see gen_tax_seed.py header for exact source list). Apply with:
--   docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml exec -T db psql -U productivity -d productivity < tax_brackets_seed.sql
--
-- KNOWN GAPS (see plan's "Known limitations"):
--   * Graduated states only have 'single' and 'married_filing_jointly' seeded -- a
--     request for 'married_filing_separately' or 'head_of_household' in one of those
--     states will 500 ("no tax bracket data seeded") until someone sources and adds
--     those columns for that state.
--   * Washington is seeded at 0% (no wage/ordinary income tax) but its real separate
--     7%/9% excise tax on capital gains over $1,000,000/yr is NOT modeled.

